correctness[orphan-task]: task from `@spawn` is never waited
 --> positive.jl:4:9
  |
4 |         Threads.@spawn run(job)
  |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ task discarded
  |
  = why: exception inside task is stored in task; nobody reads it, so failure stays silent
  = fix: keep task and `wait` or `fetch` it, or wrap starts in `@sync`   [manual]
  = docs: corset explain orphan-task

correctness[orphan-task]: task from `@async` is never waited
 --> positive.jl:9:1
  |
9 | @async serve()
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ task discarded
  |
  = why: exception inside task is stored in task; nobody reads it, so failure stays silent
  = fix: keep task and `wait` or `fetch` it, or wrap starts in `@sync`   [manual]
  = docs: corset explain orphan-task

